PolynomialOIAlgebra -- the class of all Noetherian polynomial OI-algebras over a field
**************************************************************************************

Description
===========

This type implements OI-algebras of the form
$(\mathbf{X}^{\text{OI},1})^{\otimes c}$ for some integer $c>0$. To make a
PolynomialOIAlgebra object, use *note makePolynomialOIAlgebra:
makePolynomialOIAlgebra,. Each PolynomialOIAlgebra object is equipped with a
variable order; see *note VariableOrder: VariableOrder,.

+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ, VariableOrder => RowDownColUp)|
|                                                                         |
|o1 = Number of variable rows: 2                                          |
|     Variable symbol: x                                                  |
|     Base field: QQ                                                      |
|     Variable order: RowDownColUp                                        |
|                                                                         |
|o1 : PolynomialOIAlgebra                                                 |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+

