makePolynomialOIAlgebra -- make a PolynomialOIAlgebra object
************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        makePolynomialOIAlgebra(c,x,K)
  * Inputs:
      * c, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * x, a *note symbol: (Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,, 
      * K, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * VariableOrder => ..., default value RowUpColUp
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note PolynomialOIAlgebra:
        PolynomialOIAlgebra,,

Description
===========

Makes a polynomial OI-algebra over the field K with c rows of variables in the
symbol x. The *note VariableOrder: VariableOrder, option is used to specify the
ordering of the variables.

+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(1, x, QQ)                               |
|                                                                         |
|o1 = Number of variable rows: 1                                          |
|     Variable symbol: x                                                  |
|     Base field: QQ                                                      |
|     Variable order: RowUpColUp                                          |
|                                                                         |
|o1 : PolynomialOIAlgebra                                                 |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Q = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, y, QQ, VariableOrder => RowDownColUp)|
|                                                                         |
|o2 = Number of variable rows: 2                                          |
|     Variable symbol: y                                                  |
|     Base field: QQ                                                      |
|     Variable order: RowDownColUp                                        |
|                                                                         |
|o2 : PolynomialOIAlgebra                                                 |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use makePolynomialOIAlgebra:
====================================

  * "makePolynomialOIAlgebra(ZZ,Symbol,Ring)"

