VariableOrder -- variable ordering for polynomial OI-algebras
*************************************************************

Description
===========

Used as an optional argument in *note makePolynomialOIAlgebra:
makePolynomialOIAlgebra, to specify an ordering on the variables of a
polynomial OI-algebra.

Permissible values:

  * VariableOrder => "ColUpRowUp"
  * VariableOrder => "ColUpRowDown"
  * VariableOrder => "ColDownRowUp"
  * VariableOrder => "ColDownRowDown"
  * VariableOrder => "RowUpColUp"
  * VariableOrder => "RowUpColDown"
  * VariableOrder => "RowDownColUp"
  * VariableOrder => "RowDownColDown"
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ, VariableOrder => RowDownColUp)|
|                                                                         |
|o1 = Number of variable rows: 2                                          |
|     Variable symbol: x                                                  |
|     Base field: QQ                                                      |
|     Variable order: RowDownColUp                                        |
|                                                                         |
|o1 : PolynomialOIAlgebra                                                 |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+

