ColUpRowUp -- column up row up variable order
*********************************************

Description
===========

Orders the variables of a polynomial OI-algebra according to $x_{i',j'} <
x_{i,j}$ if $j'<j$ or $j'=j$ and $i'<i$.

For the programmer
==================

The object *note ColUpRowUp: ColUpRowUp, is a *note symbol:
(Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,.

