getFreeOIModule -- get the free OI-module of an element
*******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        getFreeOIModule f
  * Inputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note VectorInWidth: VectorInWidth,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note FreeOIModule: FreeOIModule,, 

Description
===========

Returns the free OI-module in which the element f lives.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ);                           |
