  * Inputs:
      * phi, an instance of the type *note FreeOIModuleMap: FreeOIModuleMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

Checks if a free OI-module map is the zero map.

+-------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ);      |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = makeFreeOIModule(e, {2}, P);            |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : installGeneratorsInWidth(F, 2);             |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : b = e_(2,{1,2},1);                          |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : C = oiRes({b}, 2)                           |
|                                                 |
|o5 = 0: (e0, {2}, {0})                           |
|     1: (e1, {}, {})                             |
|     2: (e2, {}, {})                             |
|                                                 |
|o5 : OIResolution                                |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : phi0 = C.dd_0                               |
|                                                 |
|o6 = Source: (e0, {2}, {0}) Target: (e, {2}, {0})|
|                                                 |
|o6 : FreeOIModuleMap                             |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : phi1 = C.dd_1                               |
|                                                 |
|o7 = Source: (e1, {}, {}) Target: (e0, {2}, {0}) |
|                                                 |
|o7 : FreeOIModuleMap                             |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : isZero phi0                                 |
|                                                 |
|o8 = false                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : isZero phi1                                 |
|                                                 |
|o9 = true                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+

