      * f, an instance of the type *note VectorInWidth: VectorInWidth,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note net: (Macaulay2Doc)Net,, 

Description
===========

Displays an element of a free OI-module. Note: terms are displayed in
descending order according to the monomial order of the free OI-module.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ);                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = makeFreeOIModule(e, {1,1}, P);                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : installGeneratorsInWidth(F, 2);                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : f=x_(1,1)*e_(2,{1},1)+x_(2,1)*e_(2,{1},2)-x_(1,2)*e_(2,{2},1)-x_(2,2)*e |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|_(2,{2},2);                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : net f                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = -x   e        + x   e        - x   e        + x   e                     |
|       1,2 2,{2},1    1,1 2,{1},1    2,2 2,{2},2    2,1 2,{1},2              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

