use(ModuleInWidth) -- use a component of a free OI-module
*********************************************************

  * Function: *note use: (Macaulay2Doc)use,
  * Usage: 
        use M
  * Inputs:
      * M, an instance of the type *note ModuleInWidth: ModuleInWidth,, 

Description
===========

This method invokes *note use: (Macaulay2Doc)use, on the underlying polynomial
ring of M. This is useful since distinct components of a free OI-module need
not be modules over the same polynomial ring.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ);                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = makeFreeOIModule(e, {1,1,2}, P);                                   |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : installGeneratorsInWidth(F, 1);                                        |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : installGeneratorsInWidth(F, 2);                                        |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : use F_1; b1 = x_(1,1)*e_(1,{1},1)+x_(2,1)*e_(1,{1},2)                  |
|                                                                            |
|o6 = x   e        + x   e                                                   |
|      1,1 1,{1},1    2,1 1,{1},2                                            |
|                                                                            |
|                     2                                                      |
|o6 : (QQ[x   , x   ])  in width 1                                           |
|          2,1   1,1                                                         |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : use F_2; b2 = x_(1,2)*x_(1,1)*e_(2,{2},2)+x_(2,2)*x_(2,1)*e_(2,{1,2},3)|
|                                                                            |
|o8 = x   x   e        + x   x   e                                           |
|      1,2 1,1 2,{2},2    2,2 2,1 2,{1, 2},3                                 |
|                                                                            |
|                                 5                                          |
|o8 : (QQ[x   , x   , x   , x   ])  in width 2                               |
|          2,2   2,1   1,2   1,1                                             |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

