      * an instance of the type *note VectorInWidth: VectorInWidth,, 

Description
===========

Returns the lead monomial of an element of a free OI-module according to the
specified *note OIMonomialOrder: OIMonomialOrder,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ);                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = makeFreeOIModule(e, {1,1}, P);                                      |
