minimizeOIGB -- minimize an OI-Gröbner basis
********************************************

  * Usage: 
        minimizeOIGB G
  * Inputs:
      * G, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Verbose => ..., default value false
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

This method minimizes G with respect to the Gröbner property, i.e., removes any
elements whose leading monomial is OI-divisible by the leading monomial of
another element of G. The *note Verbose: (Macaulay2Doc)Verbose, option must be
either true or false, depending on whether one wants debug information printed.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = makePolynomialOIAlgebra(2, x, QQ);                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = makeFreeOIModule(e, {1,1,2}, P);                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : installGeneratorsInWidth(F, 1);                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : installGeneratorsInWidth(F, 2);                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : installGeneratorsInWidth(F, 3);                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : use F_1; b1 = x_(1,1)*e_(1,{1},1)+x_(2,1)*e_(1,{1},2);                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : use F_2; b2 = x_(1,2)*x_(1,1)*e_(2,{2},2)+x_(2,2)*x_(2,1)*e_(2,{1,2},3);|
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : time B = oiGB {b1, b2}                                                 |
| -- used 0.0349234s (cpu); 0.0349198s (thread); 0s (gc)                      |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = {x   e        + x   e       , x   x   e        + x   x   e          ,  |
|        1,1 1,{1},1    2,1 1,{1},2   1,2 1,1 2,{2},2    2,2 2,1 2,{1, 2},3   |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      x   x   x   e           - x   x   x   e          }                     |
|       2,3 2,2 1,1 3,{2, 3},3    2,3 2,1 1,2 3,{1, 3},3                      |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : List                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : use F_3; b3 = x_(2,3)*x_(2,2)*x_(1,1)*e_(3,{2,3},3)-x_(2,1)*x_(1,2)^2*e|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|_(3,{1,3},3);                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : C = append(B, b3) -- dump in a redundant element                       |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o13 = {x   e        + x   e       , x   x   e        + x   x   e          ,  |
|        1,1 1,{1},1    2,1 1,{1},2   1,2 1,1 2,{2},2    2,2 2,1 2,{1, 2},3   |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                             |
|      x   x   x   e           - x   x   x   e          , x   x   x   e       |
|       2,3 2,2 1,1 3,{2, 3},3    2,3 2,1 1,2 3,{1, 3},3   2,3 2,2 1,1 3,{2,  |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                  2                                                          |
|           - x   x   e          }                                            |
|      3},3    2,1 1,2 3,{1, 3},3                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o13 : List                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : minimizeOIGB C -- an element gets removed                              |
|                                                                             |
|                                      2                                      |
