TopNonminimal -- option for minimizing the top Gröbner basis of an OI-resolution
********************************************************************************

Description
===========

Used as an optional argument in the *note oiRes: oiRes, method. The
TopNonminimal option must be either true or false, depending on whether one
wants the Gröbner basis in homological degree $n-1$ to be minimized. Therefore,
use TopNonminimal => true for no minimization of the basis in degree $n-1$.

